cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite the paper below.
title: GSPICE
version: 2.0.0
date-released: '2026-10-29'
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/joshspeagle/GSPICE
url: https://joshspeagle.github.io/GSPICE/
abstract: >-
  GSPICE models spectra on a common wavelength grid as a multivariate Gaussian with
  an empirical covariance, and predicts any set of pixels from the others. The
  prediction can replace bad pixels, and the distance of a pixel from its prediction
  can flag artifacts.
authors: &authors
  - family-names: Finkbeiner
    given-names: Douglas P.
  - family-names: Speagle
    given-names: Joshua S.
  - family-names: Karim
    given-names: Tanveer
